# Purpose

The Aura Component Library defines every reusable UI component used throughout the platform.

Components must be:

• Reusable
• Accessible
• Token-driven
• Stateless whenever possible
• Consistent across the entire application

No screen may create custom UI components when an Aura component already exists.

---

# Component Philosophy

Aura consists of a small number of highly polished components.

Components should evolve.

Not multiply.

Whenever possible:

Improve an existing component instead of creating a new one.

