# Component Lifecycle

Every component supports

Initialization

Loading

Ready

Updating

Disabled

Disposed

---

# Accessibility

Every component must support

VoiceOver

Dynamic Type

Reduce Motion

Switch Control

Keyboard navigation

Minimum touch target

44 × 44 points

---

# Animation Rules

Every interactive component provides

Touch feedback

Visual transition

Optional haptic

State animation

Animations must never delay interaction.

---

# SwiftUI Naming Convention

AuraButton

AuraCard

AuraDeviceCard

AuraSceneCard

AuraRoomCard

AuraStatusBadge

AuraBanner

AuraToast

AuraSheet

AuraNavigationBar

AuraSearchBar

AuraProgressView

AuraLoadingSkeleton

No abbreviations.

No prefixes other than Aura.

---

# Component Development Rules

One responsibility per component.

No duplicated logic.

No hardcoded colors.

No hardcoded spacing.

No direct networking.

No business logic inside UI components.

Every visual value must come from Design Tokens.

---

# Golden Rule

If three screens use the same UI pattern,

it becomes a reusable Aura component.

